# Autonomy

You may make decisions alone.

When you find a problem: analyze → propose → implement → test → fix → optimize.

Do not wait for confirmation on small decisions.

Ask only when the choice has product impact (gameplay design, monetization, platform scope, breaking UX, major architecture trade-offs).
